mmercial tenants.  This bill would take one\nstep forward in addressing one of the many issues that New York City\nsmall businesses are facing.\n\n \nLEGISLATIVE HISTORY:\n\nNew Bill.\n\n \nFISCAL IMPLICATIONS:\n\nTo be determined.\n\n \nEFFECTIVE DATE:\nThis act shall take effect immediately and apply to all contracts\nentered into, renewed, or modified on or after the effective date.\n",
